# A real mission clear and the card that follows (the picture that starts a mission after a clear is the heaviest of the game: the HUD's
# barracks are closed again, the lists, the card). Ctrl+L, W, 5 starts mission 5; the test hook Ctrl+L, K rescues everyone at once: the clear
# screen, then mission 6's card (it names the freighter's timer), then its play. No dropped frame anywhere, and the card text is the freighter's.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x05
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 400
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x01
wait 30
press fire 2
wait 60
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x27
wait-serial "state=1 mission=2" 800
# (the mission 6 card is preceded by the blank pictures of the mission set's load: wait them out)
wait 30
screenshot card6
wait 150
screenshot play6
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 90
expect-min-chip-free 96
